      "title": "nbap: Fix a NULL pointer dereference in logging",
      "message": "nbap: Fix a NULL pointer dereference in logging\n\nThis shows up with debugging enabled and probably on a second\npass. The conversation info isn't retrieved (or set up) when it\nalready exists, so we can't dereference it to log. (The compiler\nwarning about the variable being used uninitialized was relevant.)\n\nThis bug was dormant under not usually compiled debug code for\nover a decade.\n\nFixup b205222b613d03f7f98ef3671c245cf41f1df135\nFix #20177\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
